Index, milestone tags on existing documents and triage of the dated reports
in `docs/`: [[1709]].

## Review (author choice: heavy)

Wave 1 ([[1710]]): seven lens reviewers decorrelated from the author model
(within-file coherence, cross-file coherence, state of the art in knowledge
management and data science, relevance to the data held through a paper
walkthrough of about 12 real documents, relevance to data to come,
implementation constraints on a personal workstation and per milestone, dead
angles), then one cross-vendor external pass on the assembled spec. Findings
go to a ledger; the author marks each fixed, deferred with a reason, or
rejected. Wave 2 ([[1711]]) repeats after the fixes and ends with author
acceptance and a `jetp-spec-v1` tag.

## Gate

M2 code waits for [[1711]]: [[1506]] carries `Blocked-by: 1711`, and every
other M2 child already depends on 1506.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] Children 1704 to 1711 closed
- [ ] `jetp-spec-v1` tag exists and the author's acceptance is recorded here
- [ ] The integration review of the set is recorded here
